{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，感冒已经好了吗？”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1785", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，托福。对了，你有看到纱凪吗？”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小乾？这么说来还没看到呢。”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1786", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从昨天就一直打不通她的电话。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我必须跟她说清楚。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我烦恼了一整晚，但还是不知道怎么开口。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我是男人，纱凪是女孩子。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就是会无法克制地想对心爱的女朋友做各种事情。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想到受不了。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不知道该怎么跟她说──", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……怎么了？你跟小乾发生什么事了吗？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1787", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，这个……”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“能说的话就说说看吧？但不想说的话也没关系啦。”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1788", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也有女朋友的隼太是怎么做的？", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他怎么面对自己的欲望？", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……隼太。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想到这里，我决定找他商量了。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“比如说，跟女朋友两个人在房间独处的时候，那个……是什么气氛？”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噗哈，突然就问这么私密的问题啊～”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1789", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉，你不想回答也没关系。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛……”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1790", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算是隼太，这种事果然不想跟别人讨论吧，我觉得有点抱歉。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……会想东想西对吧？跟喜欢的女孩子一起在房间里……”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，是那个意思啊。那当然了会想了，毕竟我也是男人。”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1791", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种时候，你会怎么做……？”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“原来如此，这就是你现在的烦恼啊……”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1792", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“老实说，我不知道该怎么办。明明想好好珍惜她……”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是太爱纱凪了，我克制不住自己。我觉得下次我真的会把她弄坏。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概是因为隼太一脸他能明白的表情，所以我一股脑全说了出来。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪虽然一直主动靠近我……可是我绝对会做出比她想像得更过分的事情。”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那样不行吧……一想到这里我就裹足不前。就算被她要求我也无法回应。”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是也因为这样，让纱凪哭了……我到底该怎么办才好──”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……毕竟新吾也是男孩子嘛。”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1793", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“同样身为男人，我非～常明白一个人烦恼那种事的心情。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1794", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是！就是这种事情才应该跟女朋友两个人一起决定不是吗？”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1795", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这不能参考别人的状况。必须好好说清楚，由你跟小乾自己决定。”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1796", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“────”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我恍然大悟。", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是……你说的对……”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为什么这么简单的道理我却没注意到呢。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我担心纱凪不能理解。", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我不想让那个纯情可爱的女孩子看到男人丑陋的欲望。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是这全部都只是我一个人的想法。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是两个人的感情……不把自己的不安或忧虑全部摊开来说就没有意义。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然要说出自己的欲望还是有点尴尬。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是我已经经历过了。因为彼此坦白，所以我们才能结合。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因此，想要更往前一步的话……", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拿出勇气。”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn6522", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“加油吧。这是每个男人都要走过的路。”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1797", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太也走过了吗？”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们决定在学生时期连接吻都不做。”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1798", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那样……不会很难受吗？”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过这是两个人决定的事。所以难受也是一起承担。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "_ht1799", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太的话语回响在我心中。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──难受也是一起承担。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一开始就没必要一个人烦恼。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我身边有跟我一起烦恼的人了。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一天，纱凪没有来学校。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "２月１２日。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次我不会忘了。", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是我跟纱凪交往的２个月纪念日。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想见她，有话想跟她说。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你不接电话吗？是瓜生君打来的吧。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6636", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……爱理代替我接。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4974", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么可能那样做。”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6637", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且，瓜生君没有生气喔。”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6638", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4975", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天，在那之后我不想回家，所以就跑来爱理的家。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不知道该用什么表情面对新吾。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是新吾很困扰的样子。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4976", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且我也真是的，新吾感冒都还没完全恢复就跑进他房间……”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4977", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果被新吾拒绝了。", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这也是当然的。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有考虑到新吾的身体状况，还那样索吻……", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，我甚至要求那种……会怀上小宝宝的事……也就是做爱。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后还大喊那种任性的话，然后就跑走了。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 80, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘我不知道新吾在想什么……’", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4972", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘我也……不知道该怎么做才好了！’", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4973", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“他绝对厌烦我了……啊啊我不想去学校……”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4978", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是因为你做那种不习惯的事情。纱凪打从一开始就不适合当肉食系。”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6639", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我也不是自己想要才挑战肉食系的……”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4979", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我不会问太多，但总之你是希望瓜生君想要你吧？”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6973", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……那个，已经很久没有了……而且最近的新吾感觉在克制自己……”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn7155", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是想告诉他……你可以想要我，或者说，希望他强硬地夺取我……”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn7156", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，嗯，虽然我也不是不想知道那个纱凪之所以会做出这些事情的心路历程……”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6974", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是就算听了我也不懂，所以就我了解的部分，可以听我说一句话吗？”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6975", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn7157", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不体贴对方、逼迫对方满足自己的欲望，甚至举止粗暴也要夺取……”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6976", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会做出这种事的人，这才是瓜生君吧？”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6641", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4981", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理的话让我恍然大悟。", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有错。我就是喜欢那样的新吾。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟他在一起就好安心。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可以让我老实撒娇的人。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "用嘴唇、身体、自己的全部传达心意……而他就是会包容一切的人。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚交往的时候也是、那个平安夜也是，都让我越来越喜欢他了。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道的。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明知道……心中却好苦涩。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，你今天就回家去吧。理央君也会担心的。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6642", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是２月１２日。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟新吾交往的２个月纪念日。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明就想着这次要好好庆祝。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉爱理，可以让我再住一晚吗……？”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4982", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的，纱凪什么时候变成这么脆弱的女孩子了……”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6643", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……因为新吾太宠我了。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4983", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君啊。”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6644", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真、真的很厉害喔！感觉把我对男性的观念都完全改变了……”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4984", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明知道这样下去自己会变得很糟糕，却离不开他……”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4985", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像在蜂蜜中溺水，有人还从上面洒一大堆砂糖的感觉。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4986", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“甚至这样还比不上他的甜度。”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4987", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好像会反胃的甜度。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6645", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而、而且那个，爱、爱爱的时候，怎么说呢，很有男子气概……非常……”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn7158", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂……不要说那种赤裸裸的事情！”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6977", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱、抱歉。总之，我很迷恋他，整个人陶醉其中了……”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn7159", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……多谢招待。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6978", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉唉……我找了一个很不得了的人当男朋友呢……”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn7160", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然我觉得纱凪也很不得了……好吧，也就是那么回事吧，大概。”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6979", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……什么意思？”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn7161", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们半斤八两的意思。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6980", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为纱凪也让那个不得了的人对你着迷了。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "ar6981", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新、新吾……有吗……”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sn7162", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……老实说，我没自信。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一开始应该是有的。可是不知道什么时候起，就消失了。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果新吾对我着迷的话，昨天……就不会变成那样了吧。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早就进行第２次的爱爱……", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，从初体验至今也２个月左右了，别说第２次，次数应该是数也数不清了。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，是不是我不够性感啊……”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "_sn4990", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是盐加得不够吧。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "_ar6647", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算穿着棉袍还是比我更性感的爱理。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个渣虫的话今天不会回来。刚才打电话说了。”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0447", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她有说她在哪里吗？”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不知道。只说在朋友那里。”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0448", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。谢谢你告诉我。”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "社团活动结束后我来到纱凪家。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算理央君说她不会回来，我也没离开。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "２月１２日就快结束了。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纪念日要过去了。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“干脆分手吧？女人很麻烦的。”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0449", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉，可以让我在这里多等一下吗？”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0450", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很冷，进家里等吧？”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0451", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，没关系。之前我也曾经让你的姐姐在外面等我。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种人，让她等多久都可以。”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0452", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“理央君进去吧。要是感冒就糟糕了。”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我打电话给她吧？”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0453", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢，但是没关系。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0454", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你真的很喜欢呢，那个笨蛋。”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0455", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊，用文字或数字都没办法表达的喜欢。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那个笨蛋也是。”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0456", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我的姐姐也一样。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0457", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以……”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0458", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要抛弃那个笨蛋喔。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "_ri0459", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 417, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我摸摸理央君的头。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 161, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两人对彼此笑了笑。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 162, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "交往１个月的纪念日那天，纱凪等我的时候在想什么呢？", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 163, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一边猜想，一边度过了２个月纪念日的夜晚……", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
